ents including the permits with conditions as required by orders for the production of documents nos 580 and 595. Andrew McLachlan I put the question on the motion moved by Senator Roberts.","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9393","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-09-16/2"}
